        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Emanuel Ungaro— In October 2021, we entered into a 10-year exclusive global licensing agreement with Emanuel Ungaro for the creation, development and distribution of fragrances and fragrance related products, under the Emanuel Ungaro brand.",
        "start_character": 23543,
