        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We identify prestige brands that can be developed and marketed into full and varied product families and, with our technical knowledge and practical experience gained over time, take licensed brand names through all phases of concept, development, manufacturing, marketing and distribution.",
